[BriefingSubmissions.SIEGE.defend_prk.attack_usa.Mission.Description]
The bridge is strategically important. You must advance and stage a preemptive strike on the attacking enemy. Pay attention to the left flank, which is vulnerable and may be breached by infantry teams. You must hold the bridge at all costs.

[BriefingSubmissions.DEFEND.defend_prk.attack_usa.Mission.Description]
The bridge is strategically important. You must advance and stage a preemptive strike on the attacking enemy. Pay attention to the left flank, which is vulnerable and may be breached by infantry teams. You must hold the bridge at all costs.

